.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "2024" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "mystfunctions.h"
int mystrcat(char *dest, const char *src);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrcat
appends the null-terminated string
.I src
to the end of the string in
.IR dest ,
overwriting the null byte at the end of
.I dest
and adding a new one. The destination buffer must be large enough.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the length of the concatenated string.
.SH AUTHOR
Noor <nnoor6@example.com>
